INVOICE_DEFAULT_UNPAYED_SORT_ORDER = Default Sort Order in Unpaid Billing Tables and Lists
INVOICE_DEFAULT_UNPAYED_SORT_ORDERTooltip = For increasing order, set the value: 'ASC' and for descending order, set the value: 'DESC'. If empty, the sort order will be descending order (invoice dates).
CUSTOMERSOWEDREPORT_EXCLUDE_DP = Exclude, by default, down payment invoices
CUSTOMERSOWEDREPORT_EXCLUDE_DPTooltip = If no choice is made by the user, the option 'Exclude deposit invoices' will be checked.
CUSTOMERSOWEDREPORT_ONLY_LATE = By default, select only late payment invoices
CUSTOMERSOWEDREPORT_ONLY_LATETooltip = If no choice is made by the user, the option 'Only late payment invoices' will be checked.
CUSTOMERSOWEDREPORT_ONLY_CREATED_BY = Show the option to choose 'Only invoices created by' a user
CUSTOMERSOWEDREPORT_ONLY_CREATED_BYTooltip = If no choice is made by the user, this one will be automatically selected. Thus, only the invoices due, created by this user, will be displayed. <br/> If 'Due to Customers' emails are sent by 'Scheduled Work', each user will receive a list of the (remaining due) invoices they have created.
CUSTOMERSOWEDREPORT_ONLY_SALESREPRESENTATIVE = Show the option to choose 'Only customer invoices where the salesperson is' the user
CUSTOMERSOWEDREPORT_ONLY_SALESREPRESENTATIVETooltip = By default, select the user to display only the invoices due from the customers of which he is the sales representative. <br/> If 'Due to customers' emails are sent by a 'Scheduled Work', each sales representative will receive the list of invoices (remaining due) from the customers assigned.
CUSTOMERSOWEDREPORT_DEFAULT_FILTER_HT_COLUMN = Automatically place the column 'Amount HT' in the search filter of the customer view
CUSTOMERSOWEDREPORT_DEFAULT_FILTER_HT_COLUMNTooltip = For the column 'Amount HT' to be displayed by default, set the value: '1'
CUSTOMERSOWEDREPORT_PDF_HEADER_TABLE_BACKGROUND_COLOR = Background <b> color code </ b> for table headers, PDF files
CUSTOMERSOWEDREPORT_PDF_HEADER_TABLE_BACKGROUND_COLORTooltip = For example, for a blue background, set the value: '# 467FCF'. If empty, the background color of the top menu (displayed on the screen) will be used.
CUSTOMERSOWEDREPORT_PDF_HEADER_TABLE_TITLE_TEXT_COLOR = Text <b> Text Code </ b> for Table Headers in PDF Files
CUSTOMERSOWEDREPORT_PDF_HEADER_TABLE_TITLE_TEXT_COLORTooltip = For example, for white text, set the value: '#FFFFFF'. If empty, the white color will be used.
CUSTOMERSOWEDREPORT_WARNING_IMAGE_NAME = To change the payment delay alert image
CUSTOMERSOWEDREPORT_WARNING_IMAGE_NAMETooltip = To not display an image, set the value to 'none'. Here are other examples of possible values: 'error', 'high', 'status8' or 'warning'. If empty, the 'warning' value will be used.
CUSTOMERSOWEDREPORT_MAIL_CONTAINS_URL = The mail may contain URLs
CUSTOMERSOWEDREPORT_MAIL_CONTAINS_URLTooltip = If the 'Due customers' does not concern a single client, access to Dolibarr's URL can be inserted in the sent emails.
